*.Rproj

# --- Rendered outputs (regenerate locally with run_all_synthetic.r) ---
Output/
Rplots.pdf
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md

# --- Logs and dev artifacts ---
*.log
render_three_years_u110.R
force_rerender_all.R

# --- Source workbooks (confidential; must never be committed) ---
# The synthetic pipeline reads only these paths via GS_SOURCE_ROOT.
# Nothing under the source-workbook root should ever be committed.
source_workbooks/
GS_SOURCE_ROOT/

# --- Claude Code local config ---
# Session-local settings and slash commands; not part of the published analysis.
.claude/
# Agent instructions referencing the private parent folder; not for publication.
CLAUDE.md

# --- Bulk intermediate artifacts (regenerate with run_all_synthetic.r) ---
# ~360 per-u .rds files. They recreate byte-for-byte from data/*.csv, so the
# repository documents the regeneration rather than carrying the bulk.
artifacts/u_*/
# Manuscript feed for the private paper folder, not part of this deliverable.
# It also records an absolute artifacts path from the machine that produced it.
artifacts/paper_feed.json

# --- Pipeline diagnostic figures ---
# These predate the light/dark, README-width figure standards documented in the
# README and are regenerated locally by run_all_synthetic.r. Only the two figures
# validated by tools/check_palette.R are committed.
artifacts/Figure_1_Cumulative_Gains.png
artifacts/Figure_2_Density_Cos_Sim.png
artifacts/Figure_3_Density_Word_Matching.png
artifacts/Figure_4_Percentiles_Density_By_Year.png
artifacts/Figure_6_Selection_Rates_By_Grade_Group.png
artifacts/Figure_u_sweep_*.png
artifacts/ECDF_FOSD_*.png

# --- Scratch output folders from ad hoc renders ---
artifacts_timing/
artifacts_pool/

# --- Build output ---
Gale_Synthetic_publish.zip

